<resources>
    <string name="about_disclaimer">Designed for anonymity and end-to-end encryption – without ads, tracking or own servers. Relays, media and STUN servers are replaceable defaults operated by independent third parties; for technical reasons they can see e.g. your IP address. No independent security audit, no warranty – use at your own risk. Everyone is responsible for their own use and content.</string>
